{"run_id": "run_49a53303a3ba", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_012", "task_id": "sample_upload_task", "scenario_id": "s12_faq_cost", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "user", "content": "您好，请问现在方便接听吗？这边通知您一个发票功能更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "agent", "content": "方便，您说。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我们平台新版发票开具入口已经上线了，以后您开票会更方便。请问您之前开票遇到过什么问题吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "agent", "content": "嗯，之前开票流程有点复杂，有时候找不到入口。这个新版有什么变化？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "user", "content": "新版入口整合到了商家后台的财务模块，操作更简单。另外，如果后续您有疑问，可以查看帮助中心，或者我们也可以安排回访指导。您需要预约回访吗？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "agent", "content": "先不用预约，我自己看看。不过我想问一下，这个功能更新会不会增加成本或者影响收益？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "user", "content": "这个您放心，功能更新是免费的，不会增加任何成本，也不会影响您的收益。我帮您查一下相关FAQ，稍等。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，谢谢。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "tool_name": "query_faq", "arguments": {}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_49a53303a3ba", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_013", "task_id": "sample_upload_task", "scenario_id": "s13_faq_diff", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "user", "content": "您好，请问现在方便接听吗？这边通知您一个发票功能更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "agent", "content": "方便，请说。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我们新版发票开具入口已经上线了，您可以在后台的‘财务管理’模块找到‘发票管理’入口，操作更便捷。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "agent", "content": "哦，那和旧版有什么区别吗？我听说有两种模式？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "user", "content": "您问得好，新版确实提供了两种模式：自动开票和手动开票。自动开票适合固定金额的订单，手动开票则更灵活。具体区别您可以查看帮助中心，或者我帮您预约一个回访，让专员详细讲解。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "agent", "content": "那这两种模式具体规则是什么？比如自动开票的条件？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "user", "content": "让我查一下FAQ。请问您具体想了解自动开票的规则还是手动开票的规则？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "agent", "content": "都想知道。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 5, "tool_name": "query_faq", "arguments": {"task_id": "sample_upload_task", "question": "模式区别"}, "result": {"status": "ok"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}, {"turn": 5, "tool_name": "update_task_status", "arguments": {"task_id": "sample_upload_task", "status": "faq_answered"}, "result": {"status": "ok"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
